  <data name="CV_Intro_Line1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>I am used to taking responsibility for making sure tasks are completed in a busy day full of complex requirements. It can involve anything from legislation, new technology that I need to learn, and legacy technology that must be kept running and updated, to customer requests that do not always fit neatly into the existing applications or the needs of other customers. And then there are, of course, the unexpected firefighting manoeuvres that can suddenly arise and require rapid adjustment. This is all part of everyday life in many busy software companies – and something I am used to navigating.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CV_Intro_Line2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>My current specialisation lies in the scope of .NET and web applications, an area in which I have gradually built a particularly broad toolkit. I have been working with .NET since ASP.NET Web Forms and have, for the most part, worked with almost every type of web application in the .NET world, all the way up to modern web apps in Blazor.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CV_Intro_Line3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>It is great to be part of solving complex technical challenges, and I see one of my primary strengths as being very good at learning new things. The journey away from ignorance is one I have undertaken many times in my life, and I intend to continue that journey until my final breath, as I am a true knowledge collector.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CV_Intro_Line4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The systems I develop should be valuable and intuitive for users, while the code I write should also be understandable and maintainable for my colleagues.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CV_Description1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>I am a competent software developer with a preference towards web development as well as development for mobile devices. Furthermore, I have experience from several other areas - such as desktop application development, and development for embedded devices.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="CV_Description2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>In addition, I am of the opinion that I am an innovative person with many ideas. I am a technically competent, dedicated person who keeps working until the work is done. I work fine both in groups and individually. In short, I am a type of person who sees opportunities rather than barriers in front of me.</value>
  </data>
